{"id":"bc3e8ddddac2bb74","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-p-computable-distribution.md","title":"Polynomial-Time Computable Distribution Ensembles","display":"df-p-computable-distribution — Polynomial-Time Computable Distribution Ensembles","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-p-computable-distribution","aliases":["28-df-p-computable-distribution"],"display":"df-p-computable-distribution — Polynomial-Time Computable Distribution Ensembles","depends_on":["[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §18.2","source_printed_pages":"365","source_pdf_pages":"391","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"definition-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-p-computable-distribution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-p-computable-distribution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-computable-distribution — Polynomial-Time Computable Distribution Ensembles"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §18.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"365"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"391"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(D_n)\\in\\mathfrak D\">\\(D=(D_n)\\in\\mathfrak D\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n(x)\">\\(D_n(x)\\)</span> 为x概率，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 为同长度字典序。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 为无前导零自然数二进制表示（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_2\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 的已定义二串配对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RatCode}\">\\(\\operatorname{RatCode}\\)</span> 与部分解码函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rat}\">\\(\\operatorname{rat}\\)</span> 由下式构造；输出表示精确非负有理数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RatCode}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{tup}_2(\\operatorname{bin}(a),\\operatorname{bin}(b)):a\\in\\mathbb N,\\ b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{rat})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RatCode},\\qquad\\operatorname{rat}(\\operatorname{tup}_2(\\operatorname{bin}(a),\\operatorname{bin}(b)))\\coloneqq a/b\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb N,\\ b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RatCode}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{tup}_2(\\operatorname{bin}(a),\\operatorname{bin}(b)):a\\in\\mathbb N,\\ b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{rat})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RatCode},\\qquad\\operatorname{rat}(\\operatorname{tup}_2(\\operatorname{bin}(a),\\operatorname{bin}(b)))\\coloneqq a/b\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb N,\\ b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_D(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{|x|}:y\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}x}D_{|x|}(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_D(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{|x|}:y\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}x}D_{|x|}(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PComp}(D)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ [F(x)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{rat})\\land\\operatorname{rat}(F(x))=\\mu_D(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PComp}(D)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ [F(x)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{rat})\\land\\operatorname{rat}(F(x))=\\mu_D(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按教材计算累积概率，而非只算单点概率。显式有限有理编码补足机器输出类型；若允许可计算实数近似则是另一模型，不从本定义自动推出。前驱差可算单点质量，逆向一般不成立。</p>\n<p>来源：§18.2；印刷页 365；PDF 页 391。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第18章的 Polynomial-Time Computable Distribution Ensembles，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D=(D_n)\\in\\mathfrak D$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$D_n(x)$ 为x概率，$\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 为同长度字典序。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$\\operatorname{bin}$ 为无前导零自然数二进制表示（$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$）；$\\operatorname{tup}_2$ 是 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的已定义二串配对。$\\operatorname{RatCode}$ 与部分解码函数 $\\operatorname{rat}$ 由下式构造；输出表示精确非负有理数。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]；$\\operatorname{bin}$ 为无前导零自然数二进制表示（$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$）；$\\operatorname{tup}_2$ 是 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的已定义二串配对。$\\operatorname{RatCode}$ 与部分解码函数 $\\operatorname{rat}$ 由下式构造；输出表示精确非负有理数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D=(D_n)\\in\\mathfrak D","display":false},{"tex":"D_n(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RatCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RatCode}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{tup}_2(\\operatorname{bin}(a),\\operatorname{bin}(b)):a\\in\\mathbb N,\\ b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{rat})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{RatCode},\\qquad\\operatorname{rat}(\\operatorname{tup}_2(\\operatorname{bin}(a),\\operatorname{bin}(b)))\\coloneqq a/b\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb N,\\ b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_D(x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{y\\in\\{0,1\\}^{|x|}:y\\le_{\\mathrm{lex}}x}D_{|x|}(y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PComp}(D)\\leftrightarrow\\exists F\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\ \\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\ [F(x)\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{rat})\\land\\operatorname{rat}(F(x))=\\mu_D(x)].","display":true}],"bytes":2498,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a9600026c66a6d0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DistProblem}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]；$\\operatorname{PComp}$ 见 [[28-df-p-computable-distribution]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-366","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-p-computable-distribution]]、[[28-df-p-samplable-distribution]]、[[28-df-distributional-levin-reduction]]、[[28-df-distnp]]、[[28-df-distributional-bounded-halting]]、[[28-thm-levin-distnp-completeness]]。"}],"outgoing":["d4b3c83a7ffb542c","adb92775ec020a0b"]}